{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s 4 a.m. Something happened. The higher-ups are not sure what, but you have to make sure nobody finds out about it and you have to do it from your desk. That is your job, after all. So get to work. <strong>Now.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the truth through detective work and decide the fate of everything and everyone involved by sending orders to your field agents. Just remember: you are against the clock, and every action has its own set of consequences. You wouldn\u2019t like to get fired, would you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079320/extras/8f1834641776afde4368bc5f76bc5f9a.webp?t=1769186357\" width=382 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your <strong>NOTEBOOK with information</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079320/extras/0334ae7204648dedb1fdf6375c3d1c62.poster.avif?t=1769186357\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079320/extras/0334ae7204648dedb1fdf6375c3d1c62.webm?t=1769186357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079320/extras/0334ae7204648dedb1fdf6375c3d1c62.mp4?t=1769186357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it to interact with your surroundings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079320/extras/a59aa31abfb4fa94fe99eed107ebcf47.poster.avif?t=1